Try-Catch-Finally in pipeline:
------------------------------
    Handle failures and send notifications properly:
        try {
            //pipeline stages
        }   catch (err) {
            currentBuild.result = 'FAILURE'
            //send notifications
        }   finally {
            notify(currentBuild.result)
        }


    Declarative Block (Cleaner Way):
    --------------------------------
    instead of try-catch, use:
        post {
            always {
                echo "Always runs"
            }
            success {
                echo "Success"
            }
            failure {
                echo "Failure"
            }
        }

    Pipeline Execution Type:
    ------------------------
    Type: Sequential
    Behavior: One stage after another

    Type: Parallel
    Behavior: All stages run in parallel
